<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>About me on Elena Candellone</title><link>https://elenacandellone.github.io/</link><description>Recent content in About me on Elena Candellone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 25 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://elenacandellone.github.io/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Characteristics of the vegetable oil debate in social media and its implications for sustainability</title><link>https://elenacandellone.github.io/blog/veg-oils/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://elenacandellone.github.io/blog/veg-oils/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Alberto Aleta and I wrote an outreach article about our paper &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s43247-024-01545-x"&gt;&amp;ldquo;Characteristics of the vegetable oil debate in social media and its implications for sustainability&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a&gt; in 2024, that can be found &lt;a href="https://communities.springernature.com/posts/characteristics-of-the-vegetable-oil-debate-in-social-media-and-its-implications-for-sustainability"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This paper was the result of my Master Thesis, where we analyzed over 20 million tweets to characterize the online debate around vegetable oils. We found discrepancies between the scientific community&amp;rsquo;s discussions and public perception regarding the sustainability of vegetable oils.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Interests</title><link>https://elenacandellone.github.io/interests/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://elenacandellone.github.io/interests/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Organizing</title><link>https://elenacandellone.github.io/organizing/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://elenacandellone.github.io/organizing/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Papers</title><link>https://elenacandellone.github.io/papers/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://elenacandellone.github.io/papers/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Talks</title><link>https://elenacandellone.github.io/talks/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://elenacandellone.github.io/talks/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>